# November 26, 2026: Portland, Maine, and two harbour forts nearby (region mes).
# Names taken as leads from a walk-through video of the city's old buildings; every fact below comes from the linked
# sources: Wikipedia read as raw text, National Register records and forms from the Park Service, and the pages of
# Greater Portland Landmarks, Victoria Mansion, Friends of Fort Gorges, Southern Maine Community College and the
# State Street Church. The Diocese of Portland, First Parish and the City of Portland's pages could not be opened.
